826	\begin{definition}\label{def:M}
827	  \uses{def:calM}
828	Let $M_t$ be a cadlag modification of $\mathbb{E}[M \mid \mathcal{F}_t]$, obtained by applying Theorem~\ref{thm:Martingale.exists_cadlag_modification} to the martingale $t \mapsto \mathbb{E}[M \mid \mathcal{F}_t]$.
